list.item:
Doss Pasha,
                            Tewfik, Acting Egyptian Minister for Foreign Affairs;
                        Minister of Communications.

Goering,
                            Hermann, Member, National Socialist German Workers’ Party;
                        President of Reichstag.

Hines, William
                            D., Acting Manager, Firestone Plantations Company (Liberia);
                        Representative before League of Nations Committee on Liberia.

Hugenberg, Dr.
                            Alfred, Chairman, German National Peoples’ Party;
                        Presidential candidate.

Nubar
                            Pasha, Egyptian Prime Minister, 1878–79; 1884–88;
                        1894–95.

Roosevelt,
                            Franklin Delano, President-elect of the United States;
                        Governor, State of New York.

Schleicher,
                            General Kurt von, German Minister for Reichswehr, June 1;
                        Chancellor, December 2, 1932–January 28, 1933.

Tandler,
                            Julius, Professor of Anatomy, University of Vienna;
                        Anatomical Institute.

Tardieu,
                            André President, French Council of Ministers, February–June;
                        Minister for Foreign Affairs.
